              "@type": "Person",
              "name": "ABBRA888"
            },
            "reviewBody": "When I first read this recipe I thought - it's just apple sauce and since I'm not really a fan was about to move on when I realized it was fat free and I've been meaning to try substituting apple sauce in some recipies, so why not give it a try. Well, it was delicious and gone in one meal. I'm making it again today - to try in other things. I cut way back on the sugar as my apples(Cortlands) were fairly sweet."
          },
