              "@type": "Person",
              "name": "luvacook"
            },
            "reviewBody": "Used already prepared store bought apple blueberry sauce so all I had to do was whip egg white and fold together. Of course - the blueberries being so dark this was not really snowy looking-but was delicious mixed with a crisp topping.(think apple crisp) and with whip on top.",
