            "author": {
              "@type": "Person",
              "name": "Karylann72"
            },
            "reviewBody": "I use 1 egg white, 1 cup sugar, 1 apple (peeled, cored and grated); beat egg white and sugar until stiff; fold in grated apple, mixing well; DELICIOUS served over a slice of Chocolate Mayonnaise Cake, or any chocolate cake! Very old recipe, probably more than 50 years old!",
            "datePublished": "2010-03-23T10:38:46.510Z"
          },
          {
