            },
            "author": {
              "@type": "Person",
              "name": "Miss Molly"
            },
            "reviewBody": "I di this recipe a little differently. I only cooked the apples for 15 minutes then added the sugar and spices. Instead of using an egg white I used 1 Tbs meringue powder whipped with 1 Tbs. water (or milk). The apples were still chunky and I served them over french toast.\r\nYummy",
            "datePublished": "2004-10-11T16:42:45.717Z"
          },
